      "created_at": "2013-03-23T12:36:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>&gt;Games have previously uploaded all their promo heroes, backs and fronts, to BGG but not the 2 promo villains, or at least not in their regular sized form- the oversized ones have been uploaded.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Would some kind person be generous enough to scan in their copies of the ordinary card sized promos, both character cards and rules text, for those of us without to print out and put into our regular decks with sleeves?</p>",
