      "created_at": "2013-03-25T18:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can get the oversized ones on BoardGameGeek, in the galleries for these particular expansions <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/boardgameexpansion/126950/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-vengeful-baron-blade-v\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BB</a>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/boardgameexpansion/126949/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-cosmic-omnitron-villai\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Omni</a>&nbsp;or from the PDFs on Spiff's site (already linked above).</p><p>But I'm still looking for the card sized ones, I have boxes for the individual decks so the oversized ones don't fit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Unless you were talking about the hero promos, they all have individual pages on BGG too. <a href=\"http://www.boardgamegeek.com/boardgamefamily/17936/sentinels-of-the-multiverse\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Link</a> to Sentinels 'family' page, which list all the expansions and promos</p>",
